WEBVTT

00:09:59.514 --> 00:10:02.806
but without spending
necessarily a huge amount of time.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:06.106
AG: Vivek also created something
he called "inside scoop."

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:09.506
The goal: help colleagues
see the human behind the job

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:13.456
instead of just "Jamie in
communications" or "Cal in research."

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:17.363
VM: And what we did is we devoted
five minutes once a week

00:10:17.387 --> 00:10:19.514
during our all-hands meetings,

00:10:19.538 --> 00:10:21.655
and we picked one person
during each meeting

00:10:21.679 --> 00:10:24.106
and asked them to share pictures with us.

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:26.612
And those pictures could be
of anything they wanted,

00:10:26.636 --> 00:10:28.946
as long as it wasn't
about their current job.

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:30.996
And it was just show and tell.